     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>The ZOLLER portfolio offers you precise presetting and measuring machines, a comprehensive range of hardware and software for tool management, and solutions for the error-free transfer of tool data. </strong></p> <p>Cost-effective milling processes require micrometer-level precision and high efficiency in terms of time and cost. Precision begins with measuring the many geometries of a cutting tool. For maximum efficiency, tools must be quickly at hand, and tool data must be up-to-date and available at every step. With ZOLLER, all tooling processes related to milling are a success.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
